# Button Code Examples

Since you didn't specify the platform, here are the most common button implementations:

## **HTML/CSS Button (Web)**

```html
<button class="btn">Click Me</button>
```

```css
.btn {
  padding: 12px 24px;
  background-color: #007bff;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 6px;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-size: 16px;
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}

.btn:hover {
  background-color: #0056b3;
}
```

## **JavaScript with Click Event**

```html
<button id="myButton" onclick="handleClick()">Click Me</button>

<script>
  function handleClick() {
    alert('Button clicked!');
  }
</script>
```

## **React Button Component**

```jsx
function Button({ onClick, children }) {
  return (
    <button 
      onClick={onClick}
      style={{
        padding: '12px 24px',
        backgroundColor: '#007bff',
        color: 'white',
        border: 'none',
        borderRadius: '6px',
        cursor: 'pointer'
      }}
    >
      {children}
    </button>
  );
}
```

